{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_006_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1085d56da7c8dafff7e9aa61e6e721aea4967163f4f41344b79213e5d339075e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e42cdc7cbd9eaacf20cf194af98144ae8a918cdf9ad2c5fcd6503d9d0bf75eb8",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n原来您在这里啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96d8e7fdb1b8cef9c322e23817b4d8fdc82d9c58fd2537248aff9423f4d62455",
      "text": "今天是白色情人节对吧！\n所以，我想把这个交给制作人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afb137af5afc9ed7a0ac38c40a07132de9e24e9677f2ebf1b9028db195c46acc",
      "text": "给，请收下！\n这是情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2764990516efa64497ecc64f0a7000366e26867d49be36c4b6a7bc90eeed9ec5",
      "text": "希望能尽量送一份让您开心的东西，\n所以我很努力地挑选了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb4e2ab03d1aa0110f075bb49dbceba8a4e1c20bf14395446dda72f4da8d94b9",
      "text": "今后，为了能一直在身旁为我加油鼓劲的\n●●●●プロデューサー，我也会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:abb350ce8e9e648dc6f1b392b7e78c536552e87dafed3329c8d6ad1d06499e67",
      "text": "虽然我现在可能还是个靠不住的偶像，\n但今后也请多多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7dfa1ef4b4abb927c9c1d371fd566a11b35af53e4bd429604571c43a15d0c3c",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，在这边！\n抱歉在您百忙之中特地把您叫出来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34a6a3764ca87117fd4387cc43b3e7da9d80590ee4d3fbf4bba9051aac9b123d",
      "text": "其实，我有想从我这边\n交给制作人的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf35ff34784b8335cfab17ffc38459eb053c9bd589f5a022fd52cda6f3237780",
      "text": "白色情人节快乐！情人节的时候\n非常感谢。这个，是我的心意。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:460350e2bf1974e75c7cd8c3d13c1f9daa379d17c708f3ead6f04dd12155e2cf",
      "text": "这个……我真的可以收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！好开心",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a6ae41f6d928d9d3110d2961459030c3b3d1b734ff7551083864d27a53682f",
      "text": "是的！为了能让●●●●プロデューサー感到开心，\n我以自己的方式用心挑选了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b7434cb722ec173f4574701cb89ad0d7ae2cbe3f3aeb616d505c6744e50cfde",
      "text": "呵呵，看来您很喜欢，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d5d5f389e23eb54fa8d658cec058cc6f04062f15e482b1b13e6db96bc6f2e9",
      "text": "之前我一直迫不及待想快点送给您，\n如今总算能交到您手上，我也好高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:008ebf857cc19f9875e52b2c4a3bf612aee4c684223e1f82da9e6963b433ac62",
      "text": "话虽如此……能让制作人开心，\n还能像这样创造出只有两个人慢慢聊天的机会，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef8a017580d1f5411969c66a2dbfb5aa8380bad978091d8e11ec2d0ed249901d",
      "text": "明明是白色情人节，却觉得好像是我\n又收到了一份礼物呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a93a54d15b622da5573b5f59cecbefe753ee1acf670b347fdfa7fd0fb509c55c",
      "text": "好了，我们差不多该回事务所了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_006_22:5_02_006_22_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d9f5b864e7560414793825d2ca2d7c52ad1e54e2918a3c3ed08d0522fb3df7",
      "text": "在到达事务所之前，能不能请您\n再陪我聊一会儿呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
